.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/

# Process 3's DOCX output embeds the private translations-templates repo's
# actual brand images (cover-band.png, sponsors.png) verbatim in word/media/
# -- unlike the PDF, which is the one sanctioned public-distribution format
# per explicit policy, a .docx must never be committed to this PUBLIC repo.
# This is a structural backstop for that policy, not the only enforcement of
# it -- see tooling/README.md's Process 3 section.
**/release/*.docx
